<title>UK: Hypothekenbank (Hamburg) add 50 mln marks to bond.</title>
<headline>Hypothekenbank (Hamburg) add 50 mln marks to bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was increased earlier today to 150 million marks from 100 million marks, lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN HAMBURG AG</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.00	MATURITY    06.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    =d.mmm.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    HAMBURG   DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES   *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MILLION MARKS ON 04.FEB.98</p>
<p>	  **TILL 06.FEB.98 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR 5.25 PCT</p>
<p>	    THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
